{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05003","headline":"夜泊越州逢北使 · 沈佺期","name":"夜泊越州逢北使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天地降雷雨，放逐还国都。\n重以风潮事，年月戒回舻。\n容颜荒外老，心想域中愚。\n憩泊在兹夜，炎云逐斗枢。\n䬓{风兪}萦海若，霹雳耿天吴。\n鳌拚羣岛失，鲸吞衆流输。\n偶逢金华使，握手泪相濡。\n饥共噬齐枣，眠共席秦蒲。\n既北思攸济，将南睿所图。\n往来固无咎，何忽惮前桴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05003.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05003","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}